# Frontend environment (Vite). Copy to `.env` and adjust as needed.
#
# Default: relative `/api` so the Vite dev proxy forwards to the backend on
# http://localhost:3000 with no CORS changes required (backend is read-only).
# For a deployed backend, set the absolute API base instead:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
